"""rules_brand — wear a brand, without building one.

Deliberately dependency-free. Every dependency added here lands in the graph of
every repo that wants a stylesheet and a favicon, which is the exact problem this
module exists to remove: before it, a repo that merely used a brand had to be a
brand PIPELINE — shapely, Pillow, pip, a Python toolchain and a generator.

The producing side lives in `brando`, which has all of those and should.
"""

module(
    name = "rules_brand",
    version = "0.1.0",
    compatibility_level = 1,
)
